	(text "Pin Definitions\n\n~{ANON}: LED enable pin, low is active.\nTOMO0: LED WS2812 data pin.\nRANA: Sleep control pin; active low for the working state, and active high for the sleep state.\nKEYS_CH_*: Multiplexer switching pins.\nKEYS_ADC_OUT: Button group sampling output.\nSAKI_MOVE: Sleep wake-up pin; outputs a low signal when a button pressed during the sleep state.\n\nNote:\n\n~{ANON} comes from Chihaya Anon (千早 愛音), the guitarist of the band MyGO.\nTOMO0 comes from Takamatsu Tomori (高松 燈), the singer of the band MyGO.\nRANA comes from Kaname Rana (要 楽奈), the drummer of the band MyGO.\nSAKI_MOVE comes from a quote spoken by Wakaba Mutsumi (若葉 睦),\nthe guitarist of the band Ave Mujica, to the keyboardist Toyokawa Sakiko (豊川 祥子)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 302.26 232.664 0)
		(effects
